# Detection 7: Combined risk-based alert
# Combines entropy, subdomain length, volume, and process context into one decision aid.
# Why it matters: a single noisy indicator is not enough; a correlated risk score is more explainable.
# Fields required: host, src_ip, risk_score, entropy, full_domain_length, queries_per_minute, parent_domain
# MITRE ATT&CK: T1048, T1071.004, T1059.001
# Analyst triage: review the full timeline and confirm with endpoint and authentication evidence.

index=dns_analytics
| where risk_score >= 60
| table _time host src_ip user parent_domain query_name entropy full_domain_length queries_per_minute risk_score
| sort - risk_score
